  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Different combination of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> resistors of equal resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> are shown in the figures. The increasing order for power dissipation is:</p><p>(A)&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/629b736e-125b-4b0f-919f-c529b3b4d87e.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 103px;\" /></p><p>(B)&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5a422e32-2958-4530-82b3-c1ef47038537.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 95px;\" /></p><p>(C)&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/33003752-6431-4e56-baa0-d193effc3019.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 137px;\" /></p><p>(D)&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/9279c795-85dd-4ac6-96ed-bdeaaec9e8ac.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 59px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
